---
title: Naked and Famous
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, mezcal]
source: Classic cocktail, number 50 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour equal parts @mezcal{0.75%fl_oz}, @Aperol{0.75%fl_oz}, @yellow Chartreuse{0.75%fl_oz} and @lime juice{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled).

> Created by Joaquín Simó at Death & Co, New York, in 2011.
